# A chat linked to Slack and Feishu on a computer (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat-cc MBUI_WIN=1280x800 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=0): its
# composer let go of (a press on a message: a capsule, what is copied said in it), pressed again (a box, 抄送 in its row).
timeout 20000
until 发消息
